          "summary": [
            {
              "text": "**Calculating the count**\n\nI’m counting integers below 500 that are divisible by 3 or 7. There are 166 multiples of 3, since \\(\\lfloor499/3\\rfloor=166\\), and 71 multiples of 7, since \\(\\lfloor499/7\\rfloor=71\\). The 23 multiples of 21 are included in both groups, so I’m subtracting them once to avoid double-counting: \\(166+71-23=214\\). If the problem excludes those 23 shared multiples, I’m subtracting them again, giving \\(214-23=191\\).",
